1
00:00:00,951 --> 00:00:04,801
(Leonard:)Doesn't seem like it. She got Sheldon
to go to a psychic with her.

2
00:00:04,955 --> 00:00:08,595
(Amy:)A psychic? He considers them
not just mumbo jumbo,

3
00:00:08,759 --> 00:00:11,539
(Amy:)but extra-jumbo mumbo jumbo.

4
00:00:11,695 --> 00:00:14,675
(Leonard:)Well, Penny can be very persuasive.

5
00:00:14,831 --> 00:00:17,111
(Leonard:)She's gotten me to do a lot
of things I wouldn't normally do.

6
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:20,717
(Amy:)-Because she has sex with you.
-Yeah, she does.

7
00:00:22,172 --> 00:00:23,512
(Amy:)Can I confess something?

8
00:00:24,608 --> 00:00:25,878
(Amy:)Once in a while,
I get a little jealous

9
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:27,823
(Amy:)of how close Penny
and Sheldon are.

10
00:00:27,978 --> 00:00:30,888
(Howard:)-Really?
-I mean, not in a romantic way.

11
00:00:31,048 --> 00:00:33,828
(Amy:)It's just, she really has some
sort of connection with him.

12
00:00:33,984 --> 00:00:36,724
(Leonard:)Well... Well, they've known
each other a long time,

13
00:00:36,887 --> 00:00:39,027
(Leonard:)and Penny grew up around horses,

14
00:00:39,189 --> 00:00:42,169
(Leonard:)so she knows how to approach him
without making him skittish.

15
00:00:42,893 --> 00:00:45,003
(Amy:)Don't get me wrong.
I'm glad they're friends.

16
00:00:45,162 --> 00:00:48,472
(Amy:)I just wish he'd be that
comfortable around me already.

17
00:00:48,632 --> 00:00:51,802
(Leonard:)Well, it took him a long time
to get comfortable around me, too.

18
00:00:51,968 --> 00:00:54,138
(Amy:)Really? What did you do?

19
00:00:54,304 --> 00:00:57,714
(Leonard:)Something terrible in a former life?
I don't know.

20
00:00:59,643 --> 00:01:01,683
(Bernadette:)I gotta go.
Penny ratted me out.

